omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pY8jkkc4lDIQ7kNvwHzi9kI&_nc_oc=AdqUOo7-ASMoZgP7f3He9i6cHso7kTGDXYh0JDAgCvWfqxzm0a0eZW-C3rmwWCv1wTA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMtRD5RKStfFHmUZX4KNKz6F-mQ5MMbqdJakCD8VwRRyA&oe=6AD392B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F8B-j2xH4BoQ7kNvwHnu0p6&_nc_oc=AdqHkdf_4qsR07h0rd6R1Js15oLmA7VJhN-mqt4m_drnWYMg2R5OzL2MYkm6C71pA6s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNRcpJth7pWmdUvxtdNM5uVuJkNKjIdGnIjGCcx_W_qYQ&oe=6AD39416"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3_lft4SiFY4Q7kNvwGzu6hT&_nc_oc=Adp76I2HuuT8rZcyVxsBiobq-IMtXg9-TwmMUGBWy1JBCyuHcgJlBrN7L7-hfTZzvks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNBz9ufHgL6Hhti98UoVcaqLGbGMfadkASexakL57wbaw&oe=6AD3A937"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://